---
title: Basic SIP call through a proxy
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant p1 as Alice<br/>UA
    participant p2 as Proxy
    participant p3 as Bob<br/>UA
    p1->>p2: (1) INVITE<br/>SDP A
    %% e1 note: Alice offers PCMU and Opus.
    p2->>p1: (2) 100 Trying
    %% e2 comment: Stops INVITE retransmits from Alice.
    p2->>p3: (3) INVITE<br/>SDP A
    p3->>p2: (4) 180 Ringing
    p2->>p1: (5) 180 Ringing
    Note right of p3: Phone rings
    p3->>p2: (6) 200 OK<br/>SDP B
    %% e7 note: Bob answers. SDP B selects Opus.
    p2->>p1: (7) 200 OK<br/>SDP B
    p1->>p3: (8) ACK
    %% e9 note: ACK goes end to end.
    %% e9 comment: The proxy did not Record-Route.
    p1-->p3: (9) RTP (Opus)
    p1->>p1: Hold timer
    p3->>p2: (10) BYE
    p2-->>p3: (11) 200 OK
    p2->>p1: (12) BYE
    p1-->>p2: (13) 200 OK
